Modifications
=============
The original TPK module 1.2.1-stable was rebuilt with the FileBrowser Quantum
v2.1.0.1-beta source code (https://github.com/gtsteffaniak/filebrowser).
Nothing was removed from or added to the original module besides updating the
FileBrowser Quantum application itself and adapting the configuration for it.

FFmpeg (ffmpeg/ffprobe, optional ffmpeg variant)
=================================================
The "-ffmpeg" package variant bundles static Linux x86_64 builds of ffmpeg and
ffprobe by John Van Sickle (https://johnvansickle.com/ffmpeg/) under
bin/ffmpeg/. These binaries enable video preview generation, video/audio
duration metadata and embedded-subtitle extraction in FileBrowser Quantum.

FFmpeg is licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPLv3) with
additional components under LGPLv2.1 and other licenses; see
